# Ends a combat case; set $must (proof the case ran on A) first. B's copy must play exactly A's actions, binds,
# combo steps, charges and stances, in order. Timings are ignored (a copy's hold differs by a frame).
sleep 4
A expect actlog brief contains "$must" timeout=10
A wait actlog=* timeout=5
B expect actlog brief == $A.actlog timeout=10
